Package: sousgradient
Type : Package
Title: Subgraindient Algorithm Applied to SVM
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Erica", " Koko Ndoumbe", email ="ericadaina41@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description:  Implements the subgradient algorithm to minimize non-differentiable
    convex functions, with constant or decreasing step sizes. The algorithm is
    applied to binary classification with a linear support vector machine
    (SVM), by minimizing the regularized hinge loss. The package provides
    simulated data, a function to predict the class of new observations, and
    plots of the separating line and of the convergence of the algorithm,
    making it possible to compare several step-size strategies.
